        "text": "At Insight Integrative Health Clinic in Islington, acupuncture consultations start from £<XX>, with the first appointment (which includes a full integrative health assessment) from £<XX>. Sessions typically last <45-60> minutes. Concessions may be available — <confirm on the booking page>."
