    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What conditions can acupuncture help with?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Acupuncture is a traditional therapy in which fine needles are inserted at specific points to support the body's own regulation. People commonly seek it for pain, stress and anxiety, sleep, digestive issues, and women's health. Evidence varies by condition — see NICE guidance and the British Acupuncture Council for details. At Insight Clinic, treatment is tailored to a full individual assessment."
      }
